# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# run.budget -- The budgets of the runs of the programs of test/run.sh
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# rss KB cpu S -- GROUP PROGRAM ARGS: the peak resident set of a run of
# a program and the time it took on the processor, user and system,
# under the sanitizers, as build/budget (test/budget.c) measured them
# the first time.  A run may take a tenth more memory and a quarter
# more time, and 0.02 s besides, the grain of the clock of the
# processor and more for a run under about 50 ms: more fails it.
margin rss 1.1 cpu 1.25 slack 0.02
